# Files that define the CLA gate (PROTECTED in tools/cla-check.mjs). Every agent works through the
# owner's account, so a code-owner review can't tell the owner from an agent and isn't required by
# the ruleset. The enforcement is the `cla` check itself: a PR that changes one of these files fails
# it unless its head commit is signed with an owner approval key listed in .github/cla-approvers.
/CLA.md @soeenplop
/.github/cla.json @soeenplop
/.github/cla-approvers @soeenplop
/.github/CODEOWNERS @soeenplop
/.github/workflows/cla.yml @soeenplop
/.github/rulesets/ @soeenplop
/tools/cla-check.mjs @soeenplop
/tools/cla-check.test.mjs @soeenplop
